faqs:
  - q: Is this a full MSSP?
    a: No. We are smaller and more focused. We cover the controls a mid-sized company actually needs. We will recommend a full MSSP if your threat profile calls for one.
  - q: Do you do penetration testing?
    a: No. We partner with specialist pen-test firms and help operationalize the findings.
  - q: What about compliance audits?
    a: We prepare evidence and support your auditor. We do not perform the audit.
  - q: Can we choose the SIEM?
    a: Yes. We run on what you have or recommend a fit for your scale. No mandatory platform.
  - q: How do you handle incidents?
    a: Runbooks for the known categories. Bridge calls for the unknown. Post-incident reports within 5 business days.
